{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-5-2:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_5_2\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_5_2_p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本章排除标准适用于已确认研究人群：成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者。主要分析集为FAS（全分析集，full analysis set），按ITT（意向性治疗，intention-to-treat）原则，按随机分组进行分析。若试验参与者命中本章任一排除标准，则不得入组；不得因来源未列某人口群体而自动推导排除。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_5_2_tbl1\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"v2_n_5_2_exclusion_modules\",\n        \"block_id\": \"v2_n_5_2_tbl1\",\n        \"title\": \"排除标准结构化模块\",\n        \"domain\": \"generic\",\n        \"role\": \"body_content\",\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"header_row_count\": 0,\n        \"version\": 0,\n        \"source_locator\": \"\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_module\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"label\": \"排除模块\",\n            \"style_role\": \"header\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"column_id\": \"col_content\",\n            \"order\": 1,\n            \"label\": \"项目确认内容\",\n            \"style_role\": \"body\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"row_id\": \"row_logic\",\n            \"order\": 0,\n            \"label\": \"排除逻辑\",\n            \"cells\": [\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"row_logic_label\",\n                \"row_id\": \"row_logic\",\n                \"column_id\": \"col_module\",\n                \"text\": \"排除逻辑\",\n                \"style_role\": \"body\",\n                \"provenance_lineage\": [],\n                \"note_refs\": [],\n                \"source_locator\": \"\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"cell_id\": \"exclusion:logic\",\n                